E036's version choice is closed: comparison R1 is its working version. The old preference for the original's greater ambition remains visible in the history. The preparation of all 22 candidates is also closed; its limitations were carried into the subsequent decisions.

Completion is bounded to the accepted package. Earlier capture gaps remain in the record; this is not a claim that the complete history of either provider was captured. Exact visible fragments preserve selected text and its source hashes without exporting full native envelopes or hidden reasoning.

The guide is in English; conversations retain their original language. This repository remains private. [Next steps](ROADMAP.md) · [Publication and language policy](PUBLICATION.md) · [Verify the files](tools/verify_edition.py)
